# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ruflo agent-orchestration workspace.
#
# This is build-time tooling, not part of the website. It is excluded
# deliberately: `.claude/settings.json` registers PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks
# that execute `.claude/helpers/hook-handler.cjs` on every tool call, and
# `ruflo init` installs unsigned plugins that can run host commands. That does
# not belong in a corporate website repository.
#
# Recreate the whole workspace with:  npx ruflo@3.80.0 init --force
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.mcp.json
.agents/
.claude-flow/
CLAUDE.md

# Lighthouse HTML reports are large and fully regenerable (`npm run lighthouse`).
# The measured scores are committed in docs/lighthouse/summary.json.
docs/lighthouse/*.html
